  received within 3 days of purchase." html.valueishtml="0" )
text(name=t_31 visible="1" band=summary font.charset="0" font.face="Arial" font.family="2" font.height="-7" font.pitch="2" font.weight="400" background.mode="2" background.color="16777215" color="0" alignment="0" border="0" x="31" y="2750" height="125" width="2645" text="- No exchanged or claim on items sold on sale." html.valueishtml="0" )
text(name=t_32 visible="1" band=summary font.charset="0" font.face="Arial" font.family="2" font.height="-7" font.pitch="2" font.weight="400" background.mode="2" background.color="16777215" color="0" alignment="0" border="0" x="31" y="2896" height="375" width="2645" text="- Please examine material carefully for color, quality, and
  yardage. No claims will be allowed after material has been
  cut." html.valueishtml="0" )
text(name=t_33 visible="1" band=summary font.charset="0" font.face="Arial" font.family="2" font.height="-7" font.pitch="2" font.weight="400" background.mode="2" background.color="16777215" color="0" alignment="0" border="0" x="31" y="3292" height="375" width="2677" text="- Slight color variations between different types of materials
